{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以西结书","commonName":"以西结书","title":"以西结书","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"aa1b925988838e1371bb072e339379f03dcec5f83d41111f9f14f58e31d5e89e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1270},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["神选召以西结作先知"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["他对我说：「人子啊，你站起来，我要和你说话。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他对我说话的时候，灵就进入我里面，使我站起来，我便听见那位对我说话的声音。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他对我说：「人子啊，我差你往悖逆的国民以色列人那里去。他们是悖逆我的，他们和他们的列祖违背我，直到今日。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["这众子面无羞耻，心里刚硬。我差你往他们那里去，你要对他们说：主耶和华如此说。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["他们或听，或不听，（他们是悖逆之家），必知道在他们中间有了先知。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["人子啊，虽有荆棘和蒺藜在你那里，你又住在蝎子中间，总不要怕他们，也不要怕他们的话；他们虽是悖逆之家，还不要怕他们的话，也不要因他们的脸色惊惶。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["他们或听，或不听，你只管将我的话告诉他们；他们是极其悖逆的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["「人子啊，要听我对你所说的话，不要悖逆像那悖逆之家，你要开口吃我所赐给你的。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我观看，见有一只手向我伸出来，手中有一书卷。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["他将书卷在我面前展开，内外都写着字，其上所写的有哀号、叹息、悲痛的话。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}